        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=Here is today's AI news list from Brave Search:\n\n{{ $json.web.results[0].title }}\n\n{{ $json.web.results[0].description }}\n\nPlease:\n\n- Cross-check the news against the \"Past News Log Sheet\" and\nremove duplicates. Remove duplicate news from output even if\nthey were reported from different sources. Take some time to\ninfer the past news in the sheet to ensure no duplication,\nsince news might be worded differently.\n- Ensure each item has a clear, impactful 1-2 sentence\nsummary.\n- After each summary, include the full unfurled source URL.\n- Use bold to highlight company names or major updates.\n- Add spacing between news items for readability.\n\nIf Brave Search's output news are all duplicates from the \"Past\nNews Log Sheet\" respond appropriately with \"No notable AI\ndevelopment news in the past 24 hours\"\n\n##Output Format Rule\nOutput in text only, and start the daily news summary with\n\"Here's today's AI development news. Today is {{ $today }}...\"\n\n",
