      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Daily AI News Agent\n\n**What this does**  \nThis workflow sends me a daily email with important AI news from the last 24 hours.\n\n**When it runs**  \n- Uses a **Schedule Trigger**\n- Runs **every day at 9:00 AM**\n\n**How it works**\n1. **Brave Browser Node**\n   - Searches the web for the latest AI news\n   - Looks for model releases, research updates, and big announcements\n\n2. **News Checking Agent**\n   - Checks if the news is already saved in the AI news log (Google Sheet)\n   - If the news is new, it saves it\n   - If it already exists, it skips it\n\n3. **Email Node**\n   - Sends me an email with only the new AI updates\n   - Avoids sending duplicate news\n\n**AI News Sources**\n- OpenAI  \n- Anthropic  \n- Google  \n- Meta  \n- Mistral  \n- xAI  \n- Hugging Face  \n\n**Result**\n- I get one clear AI news email every morning with no repeated news.\n",
        "height": 800,
        "width": 528
      },
